---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="404 — Meme Not Found | MemeMaker"
    description="This is fine. The page you are looking for does not exist or has been deleted."
>
    <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100dvh-12rem)] max-w-xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 text-center">
        <!-- Fun meme illustration card -->
        <div class="relative mb-6 w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#1a1a1f] p-6 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Error 404</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-[#777]">HTTP_NOT_FOUND</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black/40 p-4">
                <p class="font-black text-2xl tracking-tight text-white uppercase" style="text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000, -2px -2px 0 #000, 2px -2px 0 #000, -2px 2px 0 #000;">
                    ONE DOES NOT SIMPLY
                </p>
                <div class="my-6 flex justify-center text-6xl">
                    🔥🐶☕
                </div>
                <p class="font-black text-2xl tracking-tight text-white uppercase" style="text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000, -2px -2px 0 #000, 2px -2px 0 #000, -2px 2px 0 #000;">
                    FIND THIS PAGE
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[#8f8f97]">
                The URL you followed might be broken, or the meme template was banished to the shadow realm.
            </p>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">
            Lost in the meme-verse?
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-xs text-[#a8a8b2] sm:text-sm">
            Don't worry, you can always make a new meme or head back to trending templates.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
            <a
                href="/"
                class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#ededed] px-6 text-xs font-semibold text-black transition hover:bg-white"
            >
                ← Back to Home
            </a>
            <a
                href="/templates"
                class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/15 px-6 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-white/30"
            >
                Browse Templates
            </a>
            <a
                href="/edit"
                class="inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary px-6 text-xs font-semibold text-on-primary transition hover:opacity-90"
            >
                Make a Meme
            </a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
